msgctxt "Addons::name::travel_core"
msgid "Travel Core"
msgstr "Travel Core"

msgctxt "Addons::description::travel_core"
msgid "Shared foundation for travel API integrations. Provides feature mapping, booking management, guest entry, search infrastructure, cart/checkout integration, exchange rates, email templates, and admin panel."
msgstr "Shared foundation for travel API integrations. Provides feature mapping, booking management, guest entry, search infrastructure, cart/checkout integration, exchange rates, email templates, and admin panel. Install: 1st Travel Core, 2nd Novoton, 3rd Sphinx. Uninstall: 1st Novoton, 2nd Sphinx, 3rd Travel Core."

